# Branch 2 - Django Core + ORM + Admin Notes

This branch contains:

- DOCS: Complete notes with errors/fixes and ORM examples
- Functional simple Django project
- Admin panel setup and migrations
- Requirements and README for reference


1- open shell by:
python manage.py shell 
in core folder while venv is running.

then add this "
from users.models import Profile
" in shell repl

2- create profile with this "Profile.objects.create(name="osaka", age=30) 
3- read all data with this "Profile.objects.all()"
4- for read all user name with age:
"
for profile in Profile.objects.all():
    print(profile.name, profile.age)
    "
5- Filter records:
"Profile.objects.filter(age__gt=50)"
# Returns all profiles with age greater than 50

6- Update records:
"
p = Profile.objects.get(name="user1")
p.age = 21
p.save()
"

7- Loop through all records nicely:
"
for p in Profile.objects.all():
    print(f"ID: {p.id}, Name: {p.name}, Age: {p.age}")

"